# Direct python libraries of the universal runtime, installed into the SDK venv (/opt/venv).
# The first block is what skills import. The second block repeats the versions the rw-task base
# already ships in /opt/venv (the SDK depends on them), so this lock never moves what the SDK
# runs on: `pip install --no-deps` then leaves them as they are. When the base moves, move these.
